# Conformance probe pack for malformed input on the `xml` wire
# (spec/vector-format.md, "Malformed input"). Public. No kinds. The vectors
# cut a document at each point of a tag, leave tags unbalanced, and nest
# elements to the depth limit and one level beyond it.
format  conformance-malformed-xml
version 0.1.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md and spec/vector-format.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    xml
root    event
field   uid       @uid               string
field   callsign  contact/@callsign  string
